    "name": {
      "value": "Wand of the Ash Puppet"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "tv"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This wand is composed of ash that has been compressed, shaped, and sealed with a clear lacquer. When you trace the wand's tip along a solid surface, it leaves a black trail of charcoal. Writing with the wand in this way never damages or wears the wand down.\n\nFrequency: once per day\nYou cast disintegrate. If the spell reduces a living creature to fine powder, you animate that creature's ashes into a sulfur zombie with the same general appearance as the disintegrated creature.\n\nYou control this sulfur zombie, which gains the minion and summoned traits. You can issue a verbal command to the sulfur zombie as a single action with the auditory and concentrate traits. The sulfur zombie crumbles into inanimate ash when reduced to 0 Hit Points or after 1 minute, whichever comes first."
    },
